  "bts": {
    "intro": "I spent twelve years on the other side of the camera as a host at MuchMusic and E! News, so I know how to move around talent, publicists and a working set without slowing anyone down. On set I capture the stills, verticals and BTS moments that marketing and social teams actually need, delivered fast and organized for the edit.",
