  "network_tests": {
    "text": "Before a pilot shoots, networks need to see the cast in hair, makeup and wardrobe. I bring a full lighting setup to the stage or backlot, shoot the entire cast, and deliver edited, network-ready images fast. Recent: Single Parents (ABC).",
